  {
   "n": 27,
   "html": "Uma camiseta custa <b>R$ 80,00</b> e está com <b>15% de desconto</b>.<div class=\"row\"><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"116\" height=\"102\" viewBox=\"0 0 116 102\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g transform=\"translate(46,42) scale(1.5)\"><path d=\"M-12 -18 l-14 8 l6 12 l6 -3 v25 h28 v-25 l6 3 l6 -12 l-14 -8 q-6 6 -12 0 Z\" fill=\"#5ab0f0\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"20\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#e5506a\"/><text x=\"92.0\" y=\"25.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\">-15%</text><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">R$ 80,00</text></svg><div class=\"ql\"><div>a) Valor do desconto: R$ <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"12\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:60px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>b) Preço com desconto: R$ <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"68\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:60px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div></div>",
   "gab": "a) R$ 12,00 · b) R$ 68,00"
