  {
   "n": 28,
   "html": "Uma pesquisa perguntou a <b>200 alunos</b> qual é o esporte preferido. Veja o gráfico de setores:<div class=\"row\"><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"132\" height=\"132\" viewBox=\"0 0 132 132\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M66 66 L66.0 4.0 A62 62 0 0 1 102.4 116.2 Z\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"101.4\" y=\"53.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">Futebol</text><text x=\"101.4\" y=\"67.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">40%</text><path d=\"M66 66 L102.4 116.2 A62 62 0 0 1 4.0 66.0 Z\" fill=\"#ffd166\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"49.1\" y=\"98.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">Vôlei</text><text x=\"49.1\" y=\"112.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">35%</text><path d=\"M66 66 L4.0 66.0 A62 62 0 0 1 66.0 4.0 Z\" fill=\"#7fd3a0\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"39.7\" y=\"38.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">Basquete</text><text x=\"39.7\" y=\"52.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">?</text><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"66\" r=\"62\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><div class=\"ql\"><div>a) Porcentagem que prefere basquete: <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"25\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:50px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> %</div><div>b) Alunos que preferem futebol: <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"80\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>c) Alunos que preferem vôlei: <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"70\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>d) Alunos que preferem basquete: <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"50\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div></div>",
   "gab": "a) 25% · b) 80 · c) 70 · d) 50"
