  {
   "n": 29,
   "html": "Complete a tabela com as formas equivalentes:<div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tab\"><tr><th>Fração</th><th>Decimal</th><th>Porcentagem</th></tr><tr><td><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></td><td>0,5</td><td>50%</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"0,25\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:60px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"25\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:50px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> %</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"fr\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"0,6\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:60px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"60\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:50px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> %</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"fr\"><span>7</span><span>10</span></span></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"0,7\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:60px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"70\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:50px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> %</td></tr></table></div>",
